      "content": "another test failed:\n- name: End-to-end tests in IE11 Mode (Windows)\n        env:\n          GITHUB_ACTION: ${{ github.event_name }}\n        run: node tests/e2e/start-server-and-run-tests.js \"npx mocha --no-config ./tests/e2e/runners/edge/ieMode.e2e.runner.js --retries 2\"\n\nerror:\nRun node tests/e2e/start-server-and-run-tests.js \"npx mocha --no-config ./tests/e2e/runners/edge/ieMode.e2e.runner.js --retries 2\"\n  node tests/e2e/start-server-and-run-tests.js \"npx mocha --no-config ./tests/e2e/runners/edge/ieMode.e2e.runner.js --retries 2\"\n  shell: C:\\Program Files\\PowerShell\\7\\pwsh.EXE -command \". '{0}'\"\n  env:\n    SE_AVOID_SELENIUM_MANAGER: 1\n    SE_MANAGER_ENABLED: false\n    GITHUB_ACTION: push\nRunning tests against: ./dist/www/index.html (built version)\nStarting http-server...\nhttp-server process started\nServer error: (node:10828) [DEP0066] DeprecationWarning: OutgoingMessage.prototype._headers is deprecated\n(Use `node --trace-deprecation ...` to show where the warning was created)\n\nServer is ready on port 8080 (attempt 1)\nRunning tests: npx mocha --no-config ./tests/e2e/runners/edge/ieMode.e2e.runner.js --retries 2\n\nLoading archive:\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimaa\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimab\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimac\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimad\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimae\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimaf\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimag\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimah\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimai\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimaj\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimak\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimal\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimam\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.ziman\nD:\\a\\kiwix-js\\kiwix-js\\tests\\zims\\legacy-ray-charles\\wikipedia_en_ray_charles_2015-06.zimao\n\n \nRunning Ray Charles and Tonedear tests in JQuery mode only for this browser version\n \n\nRunning Legacy Ray Charles tests on: internet explorer 11\n\nRunning Tonedear tests on: internet explorer 11\n\n\n  Legacy Ray Charles test [XZ compression] [JQuery mode]\n    ✔ Load Kiwix JS and check title (5804ms)\n    ✔ Switch to jquery mode\n    ✔ Load legacy Ray Charles and check index contains specified article\n    ✔ Navigate to \"This Little Girl of Mine\"\n    - Following test skipped because browser does not support css matches:\n    - Check for popover functionality when focusing link\n    1) Search for Ray Charles in title index and go to article\n\n  Tonedear test [JQuery mode]\n    ✔ Load Kiwix JS and check title\n    ✔ Switch to jquery mode\n    ✔ Load Tonedear archive\n    ✔ Navigate to Android & iOS section\n    ✔ Verify Android and iOS store images in Restricted mode\n\n\n  9 passing (40s)\n  1 pending\n  1 failing\n\n  1) Legacy Ray Charles test [XZ compression] [JQuery mode]\n       Search for Ray Charles in title index and go to article:\n     ElementClickInterceptedError: Element not clickable at point (624,87). Other element would receive the click: <div class=\"modal-header\"> (elementsFromPoint index 0)\n      at Object.throwDecodedError (node_modules\\selenium-webdriver\\lib\\error.js:523:15)\n      at parseHttpResponse (node_modules\\selenium-webdriver\\lib\\http.js:524:13)\n      at Executor.execute (node_modules\\selenium-webdriver\\lib\\http.js:456:28)\n      at process.processTicksAndRejections (node:internal/process/task_queues:105:5)\n      at async Driver.execute (node_modules\\selenium-webdriver\\lib\\webdriver.js:745:17)\n      at async Context.<anonymous> (file:///D:/a/kiwix-js/kiwix-js/tests/e2e/spec/legacy-ray_charles.e2e.spec.js:364:17)\n\n\n\nStopping http-server...\nServer stopped\nError: Process completed with exit code 1.",
